    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Amplify Your Magical Power</p></blockquote><p>Magic fills the multiverse and fuels both destruction and creation. Clerics of the Arcana Domain see magical knowledge not as power for personal ends but as a gift they are responsible for sharing.</p><p>The gods of this domain know the secrets and potential of magic intimately; they are often tied to knowledge, secrecy, or power.</p><h3>Arcana Domain Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.qdgkw6Ozfx8YttP7]{Arcana Domain Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.htfLlLESCUHbDRHF]{Modify Magic}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.eQXAC2HCOtrNwHru]{Student of Arcana}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.1YQ8R6UJLHD578Ld]{Dispelling Recovery}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.R7tUvyu0X6ZvrlsZ]{Magical Mastery}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Arcana Domain Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Cleric Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDetectMagi]{Detect Magic}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMagicMissi]{Magic Missile}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMagicWeapo]{Magic Weapon}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplNystulsMag]{Nystul's Magic Aura}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCounterspe]{Counterspell}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDispelMagi]{Dispel Magic}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplArcaneEye0]{Arcane Eye}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplLeomundsSe]{Leomund's Secret Chest}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBigbysHand]{Bigby's Hand}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplTeleportat]{Teleportation Circle}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
